# What an install of this plugin must never carry: local state, caches and
# key material. The plugin ships its manifest, its MCP config and its skills
# or signer, and reads no credential of yours; the signer takes its key only
# as a sensitive plugin option.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.seed
*.secret.b32
**/agent_identity.json
**/witness_key.json
.DS_Store
